    {
      "key": "0x04",
      "name": "hours",
      "description": "Hours of the clock.",
      "behaviour": "Holds the hours in BCD or binary as bit 2 of status register B selects: 0 to 23 in 24-hour mode, 1 to 12 in 12-hour mode with bit 7 set for PM. Bit 1 of status register B selects the mode.",
      "differs": "DOSBox-X refuses an hour out of range for the mode, and in BCD mode invalid BCD; its BCD PM hours 0x81 to 0x89 convert wrongly (0x81 stores 23, 0x83 is refused). MAME stores the byte as written.",
